  Scenario: Check for successful DXP 72 build creation
    @priority = "4"
    As a TSE, I should be able to check for successful DXP 72 build creation
    Given I log into the Patcher homepage as the admin user
    And I generate random fix content for the first fix
    And I create a Patcher fix with the following values
