      | Project Version                    | fix-pack-base-7210              |
      | Tickets List                       | ${staticFixContent1}            |
      | Troubleshooting Ticket Suggestions | LPS-93497,LPS-113730,LPS-113733 |
      | Account Code                       | HITACHIGP                       |
      | Support Ticket                     | ${staticTicketNumber}           |
    And I set the account code "HITACHIGP" as a static variable
    And I wait for "5" seconds
