      | Project Version | fix-pack-base-7210                                      |
      | Patcher Status  | Merging Only                                            |
    And I should be able to view a Patcher child build fix with the name "LPS-93497" for the child build with the name "${staticFixContent1}, LPS-113730, LPS-113733, LPS-93497" for the ticket "${staticTicketNumber}" on the account "HITACHIGP" with the following values
      | Name     | LPS-93497  |
      | Version  | 1.0        |
      | Git Hash | c15920b890 |
      | Status   | Complete   |
      | Type     | Patch      |
    And I should be able to view a Patcher child build fix with the name "LPS-113730, LPS-113733" for the child build with the name "${staticFixContent1}, LPS-113730, LPS-113733, LPS-93497" for the ticket "${staticTicketNumber}" on the account "HITACHIGP" with the following values
      | Name     | LPS-113730, LPS-113733 |
      | Version  | 1.0                    |
      | Git Hash | e8dacbfae9             |
      | Status   | Complete               |
      | Type     | Patch                  |
    And I should be able to view a Patcher child build fix with the name "${staticFixContent1}" for the child build with the name "${staticFixContent1}, LPS-113730, LPS-113733, LPS-93497" for the ticket "${staticTicketNumber}" on the account "HITACHIGP" with the following values
